    "allocator_cliff": "The device KV ABI requires each request in one contiguous backing. With the default 128-page low-water chunk, a request above 32K allocates a second whole contiguous chunk while the first 2 GiB remains resident. Pre-sizing avoids that duplicate but does not create enough total request headroom for 53K or 64K BF16."
